WEBVTT
Kind: descriptions
Language: en

c001
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.108
The bald person and a younger person with dark hair walk through a doorway into a bright area.

c003
00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:28.835
In a moment, a dark chamber with metal platforms and hanging objects.

c004
00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:32.558
Both navigate through the wire maze.

c005
00:00:42.689 --> 00:00:45.940
Small figures run across high beams and platforms.

c006
00:00:48.423 --> 00:00:52.138
In a moment, both walk together along a curved metal path.

c008
00:00:57.431 --> 00:01:01.889
In a moment, multiple figures move along a curved beam among wires.

c010
00:01:07.599 --> 00:01:09.921
Both stand facing each other, gesturing.

c011
00:01:12.200 --> 00:01:14.986
The bald person runs across a platform and looks out.

c012
00:01:18.120 --> 00:01:22.764
The bald person stands close to the younger person, looking upward and speaking.

c013
00:01:23.210 --> 00:01:27.993
The two figures fall through the dark space, tumbling among the wires and platforms.
